<main id="home">
<section class="hero-wrap">
  <div class="hero-grid"></div><div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="container position-relative">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-7 fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> Integrated Financial Markets System</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Read the market.<br>Build the trade.<br>Log the edge.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">TRADERS LOG brings your market workspace into one place — live provider-backed quotes, AI technical scanning, watchlists, global sessions, currency strength and professional charting.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a href="/scanner" class="hero-btn primary"><i class="bi bi-radar"></i> Launch AI Scanner</a><a href="#markets" class="hero-btn secondary"><i class="bi bi-activity"></i> View Live Markets</a></div>
        <div class="hero-metrics"><div class="metric"><strong>LIVE</strong><span>Provider-backed quotes</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>AI</strong><span>Technical market scanner</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>24/5</strong><span>Global market sessions</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-5 text-center fade-up"><img class="hero-logo" src="/assets/traders-log-logo.png" alt="TRADERS LOG premium financial markets logo"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="ticker"><div class="ticker-track" id="tickerTrack"><span class="ticker-item">Loading live market data…</span></div></div>

<section class="section-pad" id="platform"><div class="container"><div class="section-head fade-up"><div><div class="section-kicker">One system</div><h2 class="section-title">Everything a serious trader needs.</h2></div><p class="section-sub">Built around a database-first architecture so the interface can grow without turning into a collection of disconnected tools.</p></div>
<div class="feature-grid">
  <div class="glass-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></div><h3>Live Markets</h3><p>Quotes and market state come through configured providers and are explicitly labelled when data is unavailable.</p></div>
  <div class="glass-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-cpu"></i></div><h3>AI Market Scanner</h3><p>Rank instruments using real candle data and technical evidence including RSI, MACD, ATR, ADX and Bollinger Bands.</p><a href="/scanner" class="tool-link">Open Scanner →</a></div>
  <div class="glass-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-star"></i></div><h3>Watchlists</h3><p>Keep your instruments organised and request live quotes without hard-coded prices.</p><a href="/watchlists" class="tool-link">Manage Watchlists →</a></div>
  <div class="glass-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-journal-text"></i></div><h3>Trading Workflow</h3><p>Designed to expand into journal, news, CRT, liquidity, alerts, correlations and education modules.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section-pad pt-0" id="markets"><div class="container"><div class="section-head fade-up"><div><div class="section-kicker">Market desk</div><h2 class="section-title">Global markets, from one screen.</h2></div><p class="section-sub">No fabricated market numbers. If a provider is not configured or a quote fails, TRADERS LOG says so.</p></div>
<div class="market-shell fade-up"><div class="statusbar"><span class="status-pill" id="marketStatus">Checking providers…</span><span class="data-note" id="refreshLabel">Waiting for first update</span></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="market-table"><thead><tr><th>Instrument</th><th>Price</th><th>Change</th><th>Day High</th><th>Day Low</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="marketTable"><tr><td colspan="6" class="empty-row">Loading live quotes…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section-pad pt-0" id="scanner"><div class="container"><div class="section-head fade-up"><div><div class="section-kicker">Analysis engine</div><h2 class="section-title">From raw candles to a trading bias.</h2></div><a class="hero-btn secondary" href="/scanner">Open full scanner</a></div><div class="tool-grid"><div class="glass-card tool-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-radar"></i></div><h3>Multi-asset scanning</h3><p>Forex, stocks, indices, commodities, crypto, ETFs and bonds are represented by the database instrument universe.</p></div><div class="glass-card tool-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line"></i></div><h3>Evidence-first signals</h3><p>Scanner outputs are derived from market candles rather than manually typed buy/sell calls.</p></div><div class="glass-card tool-card fade-up"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i></div><h3>Multi-timeframe context</h3><p>Open any instrument to inspect its quote, scanner result and multi-timeframe bias.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section-pad pt-0" id="sessions"><div class="container"><div class="section-head fade-up"><div><div class="section-kicker">Global clock</div><h2 class="section-title">Market sessions in your timezone.</h2></div><p class="section-sub">The session engine tracks Sydney, Tokyo, London, New York and the London–New York overlap.</p></div><div id="sessionPanel" class="session-grid fade-up"><div class="session-card"><div class="session-name">Loading sessions…</div><div class="session-time">Connecting to session engine</div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section-pad pt-0" id="analysis"><div class="container"><div class="section-head fade-up"><div><div class="section-kicker">Professional charting</div><h2 class="section-title">Analyse with a full chart workspace.</h2></div><div class="chart-symbols"><button class="chart-symbol active" data-symbol="FX:EURUSD">EUR/USD</button><button class="chart-symbol" data-symbol="FX:GBPUSD">GBP/USD</button><button class="chart-symbol" data-symbol="OANDA:XAUUSD">GOLD</button><button class="chart-symbol" data-symbol="COINBASE:BTCUSD">BTC/USD</button></div></div><div class="chart-wrap fade-up" id="tradingviewChart">
  <div class="chart-overlay-controls"><span class="chart-live-badge"><span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE CHART</span><button type="button" class="chart-expand-btn" id="chartExpandBtn" aria-label="Expand chart"><i class="bi bi-arrows-fullscreen"></i><span>Expand</span></button></div>
</div><p class="risk">Charting is provided by TradingView. Market quotes and scanner calculations elsewhere in TRADERS LOG are routed through the application’s configured data providers.</p></div></section>

<section class="section-pad pt-0" id="community"><div class="container"><div class="community fade-up"><div class="section-kicker">Community</div><h2 class="section-title">Trade, learn and stay connected.</h2><p class="section-sub">Join the official TRADERS LOG channels.</p><div class="social-grid">
  <a class="social-btn whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/qr/UMC3HRXEUSROD1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Add TRADERS LOG on WhatsApp"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i><span>WhatsApp</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right ms-auto"></i></a>
  <a class="social-btn telegram" href="https://t.me/traders_log" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open TRADERS LOG on Telegram"><i class="fab fa-telegram-plane"></i><span>Telegram</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right ms-auto"></i></a>
  <a class="social-btn instagram" href="https://www.instagram.com/s_treetreaper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open TRADERS LOG on Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i><span>Instagram</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right ms-auto"></i></a>
</div></div></div></section>

<section class="section-pad pt-0" id="contact"><div class="container"><div class="section-head fade-up"><div><div class="section-kicker">Contact</div><h2 class="section-title">Talk to TRADERS LOG.</h2></div></div><div class="contact-grid"><div class="glass-card fade-up"><form class="contact-form" id="contactForm"><input id="cfName" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" required><input id="cfEmail" type="email" placeholder="Email address" required><input id="cfPhone" type="tel" placeholder="Phone number (optional)"><textarea id="cfMessage" placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea><button class="hero-btn primary" type="submit">Send via WhatsApp <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i></button></form></div><div class="contact-info fade-up"><div class="info-row"><i class="bi bi-radar"></i><div><strong>AI Scanner</strong><span>Rank live instruments and inspect technical evidence.</span></div></div><div class="info-row"><i class="bi bi-star"></i><div><strong>Watchlists</strong><span>Keep your favourite instruments close to the market.</span></div></div><div class="info-row"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><div><strong>Data transparency</strong><span>LIVE, STALE and UNAVAILABLE states are shown instead of fake prices.</span></div></div></div></div><p class="risk">Risk warning: financial markets involve substantial risk. TRADERS LOG provides analysis, tools and educational information; it is not a promise of returns or a substitute for your own risk management. Do not represent the platform as a regulated broker unless the appropriate licence and regulator details have been verified.</p></div></section>
</main>

